    "body": "So it looks like the problem is that the version of git you have doesn't support the `--no-optional-locks` argument. What version of git do you have installed? I think you would need to upgrade to at least version [2.15.0](https://github.com/git/git/blob/master/Documentation/RelNotes/2.15.0.txt).",
